<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-19814] Calcite engine uses 0 as an inlineSize for index created by INT column</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-19814</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Using the Calcite query engine the following SQL statement&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-sql&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;CREATE&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;TABLE&lt;/span&gt; TEST (id &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;INT&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;name&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;VARCHAR&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;PRIMARY&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;KEY&lt;/span&gt;(id))
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;creates index for INT id column with the inlineSize = 0.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If the &lt;em&gt;key_type&lt;/em&gt; is specified in the WITH clause index is created correctly with the inlineSize = 5:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-sql&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;CREATE&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;TABLE&lt;/span&gt; TEST (id &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;INT&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;name&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;VARCHAR&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;PRIMARY&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;KEY&lt;/span&gt;(id))
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;WITH&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;key_type&lt;/span&gt;=&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;Integer&lt;/span&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;p&gt;For H2 engine in both cases inlineSize is 5.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Reproducer is attached as a unit test.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
